<template>
<div class="finished-goods" data-page="production-finished-goods-handover" data-fg-view-version="FINISHED-GOODS-UI-20261114-B2-R1" data-list-freeze-version="B3-MOBILE-INDEX-20261115-R2" data-fact-source="server" :data-load-status="state.readState" :data-visible-read-ms="visibleReadMs" :data-read-cycle="readCycle">
<MesExecutionContext :facts="state.facts" />
<MesUnifiedPageGuide title="成品交接入库" purpose="按原工单整批核对成品交出、指定仓管接收及关联入库结果，保留来源与原记录。" people="末道班组负责人、指定仓管；独审人员按原授权只读回查。" />
<details class="fg-full-guide"><summary>完整操作说明与数量口径</summary><section><h2>用途及操作说明</h2><p>{{ facts?.purposeLabel }}</p><p>末道班组长先核对全部必经工序的实际执行与独审、批次接收及原产品单位，再明确整批备交、实际交出。备交占用真实批次；指定仓管用本人既有账号独立确认实际收讫，原生入库按计划、办理中、完成留审计与库存流水。</p><p>当前终端按原工单整批成品办理。前序工序仍支持部分产出与分批承接。成品数量与各工序工作量分别保存，不要求不同单位数值相等。TEST成品库存与正式及历史用途隔离。</p><p>Codex测试代办须填写真实说明，不冒称用户本人点击。提交后独立读取原请求证明；结果未知时只重新读取，不重试、不换标识。</p></section></details>
<section><h2>本人职责及准确对象</h2><p v-if="facts">账号：{{ facts.currentActorEvidence.username }}；员工：{{ facts.currentActorEvidence.employeeName }}；{{ facts.readScopeLabel }}</p>
<label>生产工单<select aria-label="生产工单" :value="facts?.selectedWorkOrder?.id||state.params.workOrderId||''" :disabled="locked" @change="choose('workOrderId',$event.target.value)"><option value="">请选择本人职责工单</option><option v-for="x in facts?.workOrderOptions||[]" :key="x.id" :value="x.id">{{ x.no }} · 末道 {{ x.terminalTaskNo }}</option></select></label>
<label>成品交接单<select aria-label="成品交接单" :value="state.params.transferId||''" :disabled="locked" @change="choose('transferId',$event.target.value)"><option value="">请选择原单；新备交请仅选择工单</option><option v-for="x in facts?.transfers||[]" :key="x.id" :value="x.id">{{ x.no }} · {{ x.workOrderNo }} · {{ x.statusLabel }}</option></select></label>
<p v-if="facts?.selectedWorkOrder">当前工单：{{ facts.selectedWorkOrder.no }}；交接单与工单分别定位。</p><router-link :to="P.route">查看本人全部成品交接记录</router-link><p v-if="!facts?.selectedTransfer">请选择准确成品交接单，或在下方同一行点击“读取原单”查看关联入库结果；不自动选择第一张工单。</p>
<button :disabled="busy" @click="refresh">重新读取成品事实</button><p role="status">{{ state.message }}</p><p role="alert">{{ state.error || state.recoveryError }}</p><p v-if="state.readState==='loading'">正在核对真实来源及完整证明，请等待读取。</p><p v-if="state.verifiedRecovery">原请求已独立核实：{{ state.verifiedRecovery.proofReference }}</p>
<template v-if="facts?.selectedWorkOrder?.product?.sourceProduct"><p>来源订单：{{ facts.selectedWorkOrder.product.sourceProduct.orderNo || '权威来源未提供' }}；产品：{{ facts.selectedWorkOrder.product.sourceProduct.materialName || '权威来源未提供' }}。部件名称：当前成品合同未提供。</p></template>
<template v-if="facts?.selectedWorkOrder"><h3>生产执行完结证明</h3><p>{{ facts.selectedWorkOrder.no }}；{{ facts.selectedWorkOrder.closureStatusLabel }}</p><p v-if="facts.selectedWorkOrder.product">成品物料名称：{{ facts.selectedWorkOrder.product.materialName }}；{{ facts.selectedWorkOrder.product.quantity }} {{ facts.selectedWorkOrder.product.uomLabel }}；原末道工作量批次另列，不换算冒充成品数。</p></template>

<template v-if="facts?.selectedTransfer"><h3>原生交接与入库回执</h3><p>{{ facts.selectedTransfer.no }} · <PceBusinessStatus :status-label="facts.selectedTransfer.statusLabel" /></p><p>成品物料名称：{{ facts.selectedTransfer.productName }}；{{ facts.selectedTransfer.quantity }} {{ facts.selectedTransfer.uomLabel }}；独审任务 {{ facts.selectedTransfer.nativeCompletionTaskCount }} 项。</p><p>交出人：{{ facts.selectedTransfer.senderName }}；接收人：{{ facts.selectedTransfer.receiverName }}；{{ facts.selectedTransfer.warehouseName }}／{{ facts.selectedTransfer.locationName }}</p><p>备交记录时间：{{ facts.selectedTransfer.preparedAt || '未提供' }}；实际交出时间：{{ facts.selectedTransfer.dispatchedAt || '尚未交出' }}；实际接收时间：{{ facts.selectedTransfer.receivedAt || '尚未接收' }}</p><p class="fg-time-note">上述为各原事件时间；生产现场实际完成时间尚未提供，不以接收、入库或审核时间替代。</p><section v-if="facts.selectedTransfer.warehouseResult" aria-label="关联入库结果" data-testid="fg-warehouse-result">
<h3>关联入库结果（只读）</h3>
<p>成品交接单编号：<strong data-testid="fg-transfer-no">{{ facts.selectedTransfer.no }}</strong></p>
<p>关联入库单编号：<strong data-testid="fg-inbound-no">{{ facts.selectedTransfer.warehouseResult.inboundNo }}</strong>；入库状态：{{ facts.selectedTransfer.warehouseResult.statusLabel }}</p>
<p>入库数量：{{ facts.selectedTransfer.warehouseResult.quantity }} {{ facts.selectedTransfer.warehouseResult.uomLabel }}；入库日期：{{ facts.selectedTransfer.warehouseResult.inboundDate }}</p>
<details><summary>查看原入库单、库存流水及余额（只读）</summary>
<p>入库单：{{ facts.selectedTransfer.warehouseResult.inboundNo }}（记录ID {{ facts.selectedTransfer.warehouseResult.inboundId }}）；来源交接单：{{ facts.selectedTransfer.warehouseResult.transferNo }}</p>
<p>仓库：{{ facts.selectedTransfer.warehouseResult.warehouseName }}；库位：{{ facts.selectedTransfer.warehouseResult.locationName }}；批号：{{ facts.selectedTransfer.warehouseResult.lotNo }}</p>
<p data-testid="fg-inventory-transaction">库存流水编号：{{ facts.selectedTransfer.warehouseResult.transaction.no }}；方向：{{ facts.selectedTransfer.warehouseResult.transaction.directionLabel }}；数量：{{ facts.selectedTransfer.warehouseResult.transaction.quantity }} {{ facts.selectedTransfer.warehouseResult.uomLabel }}；变动前：{{ facts.selectedTransfer.warehouseResult.transaction.beforeQuantity }}；变动后：{{ facts.selectedTransfer.warehouseResult.transaction.afterQuantity }}</p>
<p data-testid="fg-inventory-balance">当前库存余额：{{ facts.selectedTransfer.warehouseResult.balance.quantity }} {{ facts.selectedTransfer.warehouseResult.uomLabel }}（余额记录ID {{ facts.selectedTransfer.warehouseResult.balance.id }}）；用途：{{ facts.selectedTransfer.warehouseResult.purposeLabel }}。</p>
<button :disabled="busy" @click="refresh">重新读取入库单、流水及余额</button>
</details></section><p v-else-if="facts.selectedTransfer.warehouseReceipt">原服务尚未返回关联入库单编号，请重新读取成品事实；记录ID {{ facts.selectedTransfer.warehouseReceipt.inboundId }}不作为单号。</p><p>真实办理说明：{{ facts.selectedTransfer.reason }}</p><details><summary>查看原单位批次、换算对象及审核证明</summary><p>按原工单完整产品对象与末道实际产出批次关联，数量分别保存，不要求异单位数值相等。</p><ul><li v-for="x in facts.selectedTransfer.sourceWorkloadRanges" :key="x.sliceId">原批次根记录 {{ x.rootId }}，份额记录 {{ x.sliceId }}：{{ x.quantity }} {{ x.uomLabel }}。</li></ul><ul><li v-for="x in facts.selectedTransfer.displayHistory" :key="x.id">{{ x.statusLabel }}；真实办理账号 {{ x.operatorUsername }}；{{ x.occurredAt }}；{{ x.auditReference }}；{{ x.reason }}</li></ul></details></template>
</section>
<section aria-label="成品当前办理"><h2>当前状态与可用动作</h2><p v-if="facts?.selectedTransfer">{{ facts.selectedTransfer.statusLabel }}；以原交接和入库回执为准。</p><p v-if="facts && !hasAvailableAction">当前没有服务端允许的办理动作；可查看原单、历史或重新读取，具体条件如下。</p><MesActionRestrictions :groups="restrictionGroups" /><details :open="hasAvailableAction"><summary>办理选项与原服务条件</summary><label>操作<select aria-label="成品操作" v-model="form.key" :disabled="locked"><option value="">请选择本次动作</option><option v-for="x in actions" :key="x.key" :value="x.key">{{ x.displayName }}</option></select></label>
<template v-if="form.key==='prepare'"><label>本次整批原产品数量<input aria-label="成品数量" v-model="form.quantity" :disabled="locked" inputmode="decimal" /></label><label>明确同用途成品仓<select aria-label="成品仓" v-model="form.warehouseId" :disabled="locked" @change="form.locationId=''" ><option value="">请选择服务端核实的同用途仓</option><option v-for="x in facts?.destinationChoices||[]" :key="x.id" :value="x.id">{{ x.name }}</option></select></label><label>准确库位<select aria-label="成品库位" v-model="form.locationId" :disabled="locked"><option value="">请选择库位</option><option v-for="x in locations" :key="x.id" :value="x.id">{{ x.name }}</option></select></label><label>指定仓管接收人<select aria-label="成品指定接收人" v-model="form.receiverUserId" :disabled="locked"><option value="">请选择既有仓管账号</option><option v-for="x in facts?.receiverChoices||[]" :key="x.id" :value="x.id">{{ x.employeeName }} · {{ x.username }}</option></select></label></template>
<label>真实测试代办及办理说明<textarea aria-label="成品办理说明" v-model="form.reason" :disabled="locked" maxlength="300" /></label><p>操作资格仍按原服务核验；不可办理的原因集中列于上方。</p><button :disabled="locked || !assessment.enabled || !form.key || form.reason.trim().length<2" @click="submit">{{ selectedAction?.displayName || '请先选择操作' }}</button></details>
</section>
<section v-if="facts"><h2>本人范围交接记录</h2><PceEnterpriseListTable :ref="e=>table.tableRef=e" :contract="listContract" :page-id="P.pageCode" table-id="test-fg-main" :rows="rows" :table-rows="table.filteredRows" :filter-schema="filterSchema" :filters="table.filters" :quick-search="table.quickSearch" :advanced-visible="table.advancedVisible" :selected-count="table.selectedRows.length" :active-filter-count="table.activeFilterCount" :sort-text="table.sortText" row-key="id" primary-field="no" primary-label="成品交接单编号" compact-freeze-primary min-width="1200px" :action-width="110" @update:quick-search="table.quickSearch=$event" @toggle-advanced="table.advancedVisible=!table.advancedVisible" @search="table.appliedSearch=table.quickSearch" @clear-filters="table.clearFilters" @clear-sort="table.handleSort()" @update-filter="table.updateFilter" @export-current="table.exportCurrent" @clear-selection="table.selectedRows=[]" @selection-change="table.handleSelectionChange" @sort-change="table.handleSort"><template #columns><el-table-column prop="workOrderNo" label="生产工单编号" width="220"/><el-table-column prop="productName" label="成品物料名称" width="230"/><el-table-column prop="quantity" label="成品数量" width="110"/><el-table-column prop="uomLabel" label="成品计量单位" width="130"/><el-table-column label="成品交接入库状态" width="230"><template #default="{row}"><PceBusinessStatus :status-label="row.statusLabel" /></template></el-table-column></template><template #actions="{row}"><button :disabled="locked" @click="choose('transferId',row.id)">读取原单</button></template></PceEnterpriseListTable></section>
</div></template>
<script setup>
import MesUnifiedPageGuide from '@/meta/components/MesUnifiedPageGuide.vue'
import MesActionRestrictions from '@/meta/components/MesActionRestrictions.vue'
import MesExecutionContext from '@/meta/components/MesExecutionContext.vue'
import {mesReadContext} from '@/meta/runtime/mesTestProcessNavigation.js'
import { useMesReadTiming } from '@/meta/runtime/mesReadTiming.js'
import { computed,reactive,inject,watch,onMounted,onBeforeUnmount } from 'vue'
import { useRoute,useRouter } from 'vue-router'
import { finishedGoodsApi } from '@/api/finishedGoods.js'
import { createFinishedGoodsState,createFinishedGoodsController } from '@/meta/runtime/finishedGoods.js'
import { FINISHED_GOODS_PAGE as P,FINISHED_GOODS_ACTIONS,FINISHED_GOODS_FILTERS,FINISHED_GOODS_SEARCH_FIELDS } from '@/meta/runtime/finishedGoodsContract.js'
import { readTabIdentity,getTabAuthEpoch } from '@/meta/runtime/tabAuthenticationContext.js'
import { PAGE_OBSERVABILITY_ACTIONS_KEY } from '@/meta/runtime/pageObservabilityActions.js'
import { createPceEnterpriseListContract,usePceEnterpriseListRuntime } from '@/meta/runtime/pceEnterpriseListContract.js'
import PceEnterpriseListTable from './PceEnterpriseListTable.vue'
import PceBusinessStatus from './PceBusinessStatus.vue'
const emit=defineEmits(['refresh-status']),route=useRoute(),router=useRouter(),state=reactive(createFinishedGoodsState())
const {visibleReadMs,readCycle}=useMesReadTiming(()=>state.readState)
const owner=()=>JSON.stringify([getTabAuthEpoch(),readTabIdentity()?.userId,readTabIdentity()?.companyId])
const controller=createFinishedGoodsController({state,api:finishedGoodsApi,identity:readTabIdentity,owner})
const facts=computed(()=>state.facts),busy=computed(()=>state.readState==='loading'||state.writeState==='writing'),locked=computed(()=>busy.value||!!state.pendingIntent||!!state.recoveryError||!facts.value)
const form=reactive({key:'',reason:'',quantity:'',warehouseId:'',locationId:'',receiverUserId:''}),actions=computed(()=>Object.values(facts.value?.availableActions||{}))
const hasAvailableAction=computed(()=>actions.value.some(x=>x.enabled===true))
const restrictionGroups=computed(()=>[{label:'当前来源条件',items:facts.value?.blockingReasons||[]},...actions.value.filter(x=>!x.enabled && x.disabledReason).map(x=>({label:x.displayName,items:[x.disabledReason]}))])
const selectedAction=computed(()=>facts.value?.availableActions?.[form.key]),assessment=computed(()=>form.key?controller.submission(form.key):{enabled:false,disabledReason:'请先选择本次明确操作，并核对服务端职责与来源事实。'})
const locations=computed(()=>facts.value?.destinationChoices?.find(x=>x.id===Number(form.warehouseId))?.locations||[])
const rows=computed(()=>facts.value?.transfers||[]),filterSchema=reactive(FINISHED_GOODS_FILTERS.map(x=>({...x,options:[]})))
const listContract=createPceEnterpriseListContract({pageCode:P.pageCode,pageType:'list',title:P.title,moduleCode:'MES'})
const table=reactive(usePceEnterpriseListRuntime({rows,filterSchema,pageCode:P.pageCode,searchFields:FINISHED_GOODS_SEARCH_FIELDS,exportFileName:'成品交接.csv',exportColumns:[{field:'no',label:'成品交接单编号'},{field:'statusLabel',label:'成品交接入库状态'}]}))
async function refresh(){await controller.load()}
async function choose(key,value){if(locked.value)return;const query=value?{[key]:String(value)}:{};await router.push({path:P.route,query})}
async function readRoute(){try{if(route.path!==P.route||route.name!==P.routeName||route.meta?.canonicalModuleId!==P.moduleId)throw new Error('页面身份不一致。');const params={};for(const k of ['workOrderId','transferId']){const v=route.query[k];if(v!==undefined){if(typeof v!=='string'||! /^[1-9]\d*$/.test(v)||!Number.isSafeInteger(Number(v)))throw new Error('对象定位不合法。');params[k]=Number(v)}}if(!state.pendingIntent)await controller.select(params);else await controller.load()}catch(e){state.error=e.message}}
async function submit(){if(locked.value||!assessment.value.enabled)return;try{let input={reason:form.reason};if(form.key==='prepare'){const s=facts.value.selectedWorkOrder;input={...input,workOrderId:s.id,...Object.fromEntries(['terminalTaskId','expectedTaskVersion','expectedTaskSourceSnapshotHash','expectedClosureHash','expectedTerminalBatchHash'].map(k=>[k,s[k]])),quantity:form.quantity,warehouseId:Number(form.warehouseId),locationId:Number(form.locationId),receiverUserId:Number(form.receiverUserId)}}else{const s=facts.value.selectedTransfer;input={...input,expectedVersion:s.version,expectedSourceSnapshotHash:s.sourceSnapshotHash}}await controller.execute(form.key,input);if(state.verifiedRecovery?.resultObjectId){await router.replace({path:P.route,query:{transferId:String(state.verifiedRecovery.resultObjectId)}})} }catch(e){state.error=e.message}}
const observability=inject(PAGE_OBSERVABILITY_ACTIONS_KEY,null),provider={factOwner:P.moduleId,refresh,buildDiagnostics:()=>({factOwner:P.moduleId,pageFactOwner:P.moduleId,factSource:'server',finishedGoodsFacts:state.facts,strictFacts:state.serverSurface,strictServerFacts:state.serverSurface,factLoadFacts:state.factLoadFacts,resultCount:state.serverSurface?.resultCount??null,readState:state.readState,writeState:state.writeState})}
function authChanged(){controller.invalidate();form.reason='';form.key='';readRoute()}
watch(()=>[route.path,route.query.workOrderId,route.query.transferId],readRoute,{immediate:true})
watch(()=>state.readState,v=>emit('refresh-status',({loading:'refreshing',loaded:'success',read_failed:'error'})[v]||'idle'))
watch(()=>facts.value?.filterOptions?.statusLabels,v=>{if(Array.isArray(v))filterSchema.find(x=>x.field==='statusLabel').options=v.map(x=>({label:x,value:x}))})
onMounted(()=>{observability?.register?.(provider);window.addEventListener('pce:authentication-changed',authChanged)})
onBeforeUnmount(()=>{controller.invalidate();observability?.unregister?.(provider);window.removeEventListener('pce:authentication-changed',authChanged)})
defineExpose({navigationContext:computed(()=>mesReadContext(state.facts)),refresh})
</script>
<style scoped>.finished-goods{display:grid;gap:16px;padding:18px;min-width:0}.finished-goods section{background:white;border:1px solid #dbe3ef;border-radius:10px;padding:20px;min-width:0}.finished-goods p{line-height:1.65;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.finished-goods label{display:block;margin:12px 0;max-width:750px}.finished-goods select,.finished-goods input,.finished-goods textarea{display:block;width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;padding:8px;margin-top:6px}.finished-goods button{padding:8px 14px}.finished-goods pre{white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.finished-goods details>summary{cursor:pointer;min-height:44px;display:list-item;padding:10px 0;font-weight:600;color:#193e5e}.finished-goods summary,.finished-goods h2,.finished-goods h3{overflow-wrap:anywhere}.finished-goods button{min-height:44px;max-width:100%;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.finished-goods select,.finished-goods textarea,.finished-goods input{min-height:44px;font-size:inherit;max-width:100%}.fg-time-note{color:#52677b}.fg-full-guide{min-width:0}@media(max-width:650px){.finished-goods{padding:10px;gap:12px}.finished-goods section{padding:12px}.finished-goods h2{font-size:20px}.finished-goods h3{font-size:17px}}
</style>
